        <t:profileDesc xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
            <t:creation/>
            <t:abstract>
                <t:p>The work is a versified retelling of the <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3530OldTes">Old Testament</t:ref>, the Little Gospel (<t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2051Nagara">Nagara Māryām</t:ref>), and the <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2072NewTes">New Testament</t:ref> preserved in two lavishly illustrated volumes donated by ʾIyāsu II to the church of Dabra Bǝrhān Śǝllāse. It begins with a prose incipit: “በስመ፡ … ንዌጥን፡ በረድኤተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ወንጽሕፍ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ መድበል፡ ዘበትርጓሜሁ፡ ጉባኤ፡ ምሥጢራተ፡ ዘመናት፡ ዘገብረ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ በበ፡ ጊዜሁ፡ ቅድመ፡ በዘመነ፡ ብሉይ፡ እስከ፡ ይመጽእ፡ ዘመነ፡ ሐዲስ፡.” The first volume covers the Old Testament and Little Gospel and the second covers the New Testament.</t:p>
                
            </t:abstract>
